1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:38,920
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:42,720
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

4
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:45,200
Sir, to get this person out of the manor,

5
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,800
we took advantage of the Nuo troupe.

6
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:49,280
While they were hauling their drum boxes,

7
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:51,560
we slipped out of the Duke's Residence.

8
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:54,480
Good work. A generous reward awaits.

9
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,720
Thank you, Sir.

10
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:58,720
Lady Lu,

11
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:03,040
despite your careful calculations,
you still end up in my hands.

12
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:04,880
Well?

13
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:09,120
It must feel bad
being trapped inside a box.

14
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:12,680
Calm down.

15
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:16,040
I know you are a fake.

16
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:20,080
As long as you obey
and help me out with something,

17
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:23,480
I will send you back unharmed.

18
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:26,720
Sir!

19
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,320
I don't care who you are.

20
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,960
Release me immediately!

21
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:36,280
Any later, I'll tear you limb from limb
and mince you to a pulp.

22
00:02:43,480 --> 00:02:44,880
Who are you?

23
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:47,240
How dare you act so arrogantly?

24
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:51,160
You kidnapped me without knowing who I am?

25
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:55,360
Old Madam Wei of the Earl
of Cheng'an's Residence is my…

26
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:00,600
God-grandmother.

27
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:04,760
She treats me like her own granddaughter.

28
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,960
If you don't send me back safely,

29
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:08,400
I'll report you to the officials
and have you executed!

30
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,240
God-grandmother?

31
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,760
I think

32
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,800
she is your actual grandmother.

33
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,840
- What nonsense are you talking about?
- What?

34
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:29,760
The fake is pretending to be a noble lady,
and the real one is a shrew?

35
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:35,480
What in the world
is the Wei family trying to achieve?

36
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:39,200
Who do you think you are?

37
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:42,360
Whether I'm real or a fake
is none of your business!

38
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,280
Let me out!

39
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:46,480
What a crazy woman.

40
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:48,200
Let me out!

41
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:50,760
Help! Someone!

42
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,600
She's worse than the fake one.

43
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:53,800
Hurry and shut her mouth!

44
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:56,360
Someone! Help!

45
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:58,480
Don't touch me!

46
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,680
- Don't touch me!
- Rao!

47
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:02,560
Get lost!

48
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:09,480
Get up.

49
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:15,360
A mere merchant
dares to trespass on my residence?

50
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,680
Capture them immediately!

51
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,360
Who dares?

52
00:04:29,280 --> 00:04:31,320
I just left the city
and came across Grandmother's convoy.

53
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:35,560
Only then did I realize she rushed back
to celebrate the Duchess' birthday.

54
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:37,160
Unfortunately, a storm held her her up

55
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,240
and delayed her journey.

56
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:42,120
I failed to welcome my esteemed guest.

57
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:44,320
Lady Shou'an, please forgive me.

58
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:47,320
Enough. Cut the pleasantries.

59
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,680
I don't like fake, pretentious behavior.

60
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:53,280
I'm exhausted from the arduous journey.

61
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:56,120
I have no patience for your idle chatter.

62
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:58,200
I'm taking her away.

63
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:05,240
Lady Shou'an,
I can't stop you from leaving.

64
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:09,040
However, this woman
pretended to be a noble's wife.

65
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:11,520
She acted suspiciously,
and her identity is a mystery.

66
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:13,080
We cannot let her walk away.

67
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:19,720
Who am I?

68
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:30,040
Surely, you are His Majesty's wet nurse.

69
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:31,880
No commoner has ever been
admitted to such nobility.

70
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:36,400
But you are the first wet nurse to
be granted a fief and a title in this era.

71
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:39,400
Everyone in the capital knows who you are.

72
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:45,000
I thought you were so blind
as not to recognize me.

73
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:49,560
I raised His Majesty all on my own.

74
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:53,520
Even your father's horse carriage
has to show respect

75
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:56,440
and make way when it sees me.

76
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:58,520
You?

77
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:02,240
Barely out of the cradle

78
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:04,400
and you dare speak up to me?

79
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:08,360
If you don't let her go,
believe it or not,

80
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:11,320
I'll burn all your manors to the ground.

81
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:15,360
Next, I'll accuse the Hans
of bullying a lone old woman!

82
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:20,720
Let's see if His Majesty
is going to seek justice for me.

83
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:31,520
Who else dares to stop me?

84
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:44,480
Let's go.

85
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:55,880
Keep a close eye on Duke's Residence
and Xianzhuang for me.

86
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:58,320
I don't care if she's real or fake.

87
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:03,560
I must find real proof
before I deal with her.

88
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:05,400
Yes.

89
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:16,520
Who are you, really?

90
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,600
Nuo dancers might be able
to communicate with the supernatural,

91
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:32,120
but their income is a pittance.

92
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:34,080
Dancers are not allowed
to show their faces.

93
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:37,120
Those who practice it
usually come from poor families.

94
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:39,320
How is it possible
that a daughter of an earl

95
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:41,760
knows the Nuo dance?

96
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:46,000
<i>Because doing the Nuo dance</i>
<i>at the temple ritual every year</i>

97
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:47,960
<i>earns me an extra 30 coins.</i>

98
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:52,400
The types of dance popular in the capital
are light and elegant,

99
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:55,520
but my maternal grandmother
thinks it lacks strength and vigor.

100
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:58,280
She likes watching
Nuo dance and Sword dance.

101
00:07:58,360 --> 00:08:00,400
Nuo dance steps are easy to learn.

102
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:06,040
Longsword dance or Dagger play
are something I dare not perform.

103
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:09,840
Back then, my birth mother
could sing and dance well.

104
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,560
She never forgets a song she learns,

105
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:13,200
but often draws criticism.

106
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:15,520
Grandmother didn't like it either,

107
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:17,440
so she never allows me to perform.

108
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,960
That was why I didn't tell you.

109
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:30,320
I only performed it in front of others
for this birthday banquet.

110
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:34,120
My Lord, why do you doubt me?

111
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:39,200
When you met Xie Hualou in the past,
you'd go mad.

112
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:42,360
You'd use the world's
most despicable schemes

113
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:45,000
just to defeat and humiliate your enemy.

114
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:48,920
Tonight, even if you were backed
into a corner by the Xies,

115
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:52,120
you were still acting calm and collected.

116
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:57,040
Wei Rao, when did you get so generous?

117
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,200
All the elders were present.

118
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:02,360
I must consider the greater good.

119
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:04,560
You had a secret chat
with your cousin Huo.

120
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,040
What did you two talk about?

121
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,360
Private matters between relatives.

122
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,360
I was afraid Grandmother…

123
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:12,360
Why did you get angry
and toss the Hans' gift

124
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,960
and ignore the guests?

125
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:16,240
You were away from the banquet,

126
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:18,840
yet the servants saw Qi Zhongkai
send you back to the banquet.

127
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:21,160
Your cousin left the banquet rudely.

128
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,200
Why was that?

129
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:27,480
- I…
- I want to hear the truth.

130
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:34,200
Compared to when I first met you,

131
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:37,600
your temperament, manner,
and conduct are all different.

132
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:42,560
Within two months,
how could there be such a big difference?

133
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:44,400
Who are you?

134
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:50,720
Tell me. Who in the world are you?

135
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,440
What are you doing?

136
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:23,960
Who am I?

137
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:26,800
My Lord.

138
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:30,080
Tell me who I am.

139
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:33,760
Wei Rao, put on your clothes immediately.

140
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:45,840
Even if I'm standing in front of you
with all my clothes removed,

141
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:47,640
you won't spare me a second glance.

142
00:10:54,920 --> 00:10:57,000
I am your wife who disgusts you.

143
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:15,560
Lu Zhuo!

144
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:27,560
As the heir, you need a wife
who is dignified,

145
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:29,480
gracious, gentle and virtuous.

146
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:31,880
I changed myself for you.

147
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,080
I changed my temperament.

148
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:37,280
I spent my efforts organizing the banquet.

149
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:40,960
I showed myself
and performed in front of everyone

150
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:45,480
just to win your favor.

151
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:54,240
What about you?

152
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,360
You sat there,

153
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:02,280
and watched as I endured the pain,
barely able to stand.

154
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:05,280
You never said a word of concern.

155
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:07,920
Instead, you suspected and questioned me.

156
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:12,400
Who am I?

157
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:17,600
Tell me who I am.

158
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:20,680
I'm a fool who gave my heart
to the wrong person!

159
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:34,240
My Lord, remember.

160
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:39,200
What I said to General Qi
and my conversation with my cousin

161
00:12:39,280 --> 00:12:40,520
are my family matters.

162
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,720
We'll only be married for a year.

163
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:45,840
You are not my husband.

164
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:46,920
Who I meet is none of your business.

165
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,640
A year from now, we will part ways.

166
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:52,360
I don't care who you'd marry.

167
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:53,720
You should leave me alone as well.

168
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,240
From now on,

169
00:12:56,320 --> 00:13:00,040
No prying, no digging,
never enter my room for no reason.

170
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:02,960
Otherwise, I'll pack up
and return home immediately.

171
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:04,680
You can explain it to Old Madam yourself.

172
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:06,240
Get out!

173
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,320
I didn't mean to offend you.

174
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:09,720
Listen to me…

175
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:32,360
My Lord.

176
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,320
She is ill?

177
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,040
Why didn't you get the physician?

178
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,760
Forgive me, My Lord.

179
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:41,400
Madam was busy on the banquet for days

180
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:42,400
and felt a sudden pain in her stomach.

181
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,000
She was worried that others might know

182
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:46,200
and thought she was too weak
to carry out the task.

183
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:48,120
She doesn't want to cause you trouble,

184
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,480
so I was not allowed to speak about it.

185
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:52,720
- Jiede.
- Yes.

186
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:53,960
Take my slip

187
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:56,320
and call Physician Yang from the palace
who excels at treating stomach pains.

188
00:13:56,920 --> 00:13:58,000
Yes, My Lord.

189
00:14:05,880 --> 00:14:08,320
XIANZHUANG

190
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:10,720
Tell me. What actually happened?

191
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:12,200
Maternal Grandmother.

192
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:15,960
I made a mistake as a clueless child

193
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:19,400
and was banished
from the family by Grandmother.

194
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,960
I have nowhere to go.

195
00:14:22,040 --> 00:14:23,840
Maternal Grandmother,

196
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:29,000
please pity me for being a lonely orphan
and take me in.

197
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:30,280
Don't chase me away.

198
00:14:30,880 --> 00:14:33,840
That old woman from the Wei family
expelled you?

199
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:36,480
How cruel.

200
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:38,880
While her decision might be justified,

201
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,840
she is still a descendant
of the family after all.

202
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:43,520
Old Madam Wei was too harsh.

203
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:47,960
Maternal Grandmother,
please stand up for Rao.

204
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:50,000
If that's what really happened,

205
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:55,320
I'll march straight to the Weis
and give them what they deserve

206
00:14:55,400 --> 00:14:56,280
but…

207
00:14:58,600 --> 00:14:59,440
But why?

208
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:01,920
Why did she become so livid

209
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:03,480
that she kicked out her own granddaughter?

210
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:06,720
You are the heir's wife.

211
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:08,000
What makes her think
she could kick you out?

212
00:15:12,280 --> 00:15:14,120
Dowager Lady, Old Madam Wei is here.

213
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:16,040
Nice timing.

214
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:18,880
Rao, leave for now.

215
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:20,600
I…

216
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:22,920
Be patient.

217
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,080
Maternal Grandmother knows what to do.

218
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:32,040
What a rare guest.

219
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:37,760
The last time
we had a peaceful conversation

220
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:40,440
was probably more than a decade ago.

221
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:45,280
It was seventeen years ago,
the twenty-third of the last month.

222
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:46,920
I will never forget.

223
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:49,480
It was the Little New Year.

224
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:53,200
Every household was cleaning
and paying respects to the Kitchen God.

225
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:56,080
After the hour of Wu,

226
00:15:56,760 --> 00:16:00,880
my son's coffin
was carried into my residence's gates.

227
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:05,800
My second son was stubborn
and knew what he wanted.

228
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:09,480
I searched throughout the capital

229
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:13,200
to finally find
a noble lady for him to marry.

230
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:17,320
However, he'd rather be flogged 40 times

231
00:16:17,400 --> 00:16:20,040
just to refuse the marriage
and marry your daughter instead.

232
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:23,280
Back then, I didn't stop him.

233
00:16:23,920 --> 00:16:26,040
Later, it became my greatest resentment.

234
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:27,840
Time has passed.

235
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:31,720
After so long,
why are you bringing this up?

236
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:35,080
When your daughter, Zhou,
married into my household,

237
00:16:35,880 --> 00:16:38,920
he treated her with care.

238
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:42,160
Zhou was good at dancing and music.

239
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:45,960
My son searched all
over the capital for famous scores.

240
00:16:46,040 --> 00:16:49,080
Zhou was laughed at
because of her modest background.

241
00:16:49,160 --> 00:16:52,400
My son fought on the battlefield
to get her a title.

242
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:56,440
My second son was
born handsome and courageous.

243
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:58,360
He was skilled
in both the literary and martial arts.

244
00:16:58,440 --> 00:17:00,080
Everyone praised him.

245
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:02,120
He was the pride of my life.

246
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:06,240
But not long after he passed away,

247
00:17:06,800 --> 00:17:09,920
the woman he loved most abandoned him.

248
00:17:10,599 --> 00:17:16,079
She abandoned her young daughter
and went away to seek someone better.

249
00:17:16,599 --> 00:17:17,640
I hate it.

250
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:20,520
I hate that daughter of yours, Zhou.

251
00:17:20,599 --> 00:17:22,960
I hate you, you old, shameless woman
who fawns over the powerful.

252
00:17:23,040 --> 00:17:25,800
I hate everyone in your household.

253
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:29,480
It's because of you that my son,
who gave his life serving his country,

254
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:31,880
is still mocked even after death.

255
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:34,240
They laughed at him
and called him an idiot and a fool.

256
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:40,120
His death brought your daughter
wealth, honor, and favor.

257
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:43,920
He helped your household
gain fame, and power.

258
00:17:44,800 --> 00:17:47,640
You even harmed my granddaughter.

259
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,600
She was afraid to go out
and show herself to others

260
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:52,320
from a young age.

261
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:54,640
It's only right for a widow to remarry.

262
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:56,800
One must live one's own life.

263
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:59,400
Why are you so hung up
on other people's opinions?

264
00:17:59,480 --> 00:18:02,160
You are the one
who is stubborn and close-minded.

265
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:03,760
Yes. I am close-minded.

266
00:18:04,560 --> 00:18:07,440
Your daughter only cared
about her own glory

267
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:12,640
and ignored the future life and reputation
of her infant daughter.

268
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:16,960
If my second son hadn't
sacrificed his life to save the Lus,

269
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:21,120
did you think Rao could marry
into the Lu household now?

270
00:18:21,720 --> 00:18:24,640
Look around the capital.

271
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:26,800
None of the educated families

272
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:29,480
dare to marry
a daughter of your Zhou family.

273
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:31,880
Do you also want my granddaughter

274
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:36,080
to disgrace herself
and marry a lowly merchant?

275
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,520
You can remain scornful
as much as you want

276
00:18:44,120 --> 00:18:46,320
but you shouldn't neglect Rao.

277
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:49,520
She was almost kidnapped.

278
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:53,240
Thankfully, she is blessed.

279
00:18:53,320 --> 00:18:56,600
Otherwise, her fate
would still be unknown.

280
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:58,160
If anyone should
harbor resentment, it's me.

281
00:18:58,240 --> 00:19:02,440
I resent myself
for being so soft-hearted and tolerant.

282
00:19:02,520 --> 00:19:07,080
I should've brought Rao home
so she wouldn't be neglected by you.

283
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:13,560
I swear in the name of Heaven
and my late son.

284
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:16,960
I've treated Rao the best I could.

285
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:19,760
I might have spoiled her.

286
00:19:19,840 --> 00:19:24,400
That is why she acted without a care
and committed a grave mistake.

287
00:19:25,120 --> 00:19:29,560
She almost cost the lives
of everyone in the family.

288
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:35,360
What did she do?

289
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:37,880
Ask her yourself.

290
00:19:38,560 --> 00:19:41,440
However, I hope all of you remember this.

291
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:46,280
Rao is my granddaughter
whom I raised myself.

292
00:19:46,360 --> 00:19:48,680
I gave her everything I had.

293
00:19:48,760 --> 00:19:51,840
What everyone else says means nothing.

294
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:56,760
The one I say is my own,
that's my real granddaughter.

295
00:19:56,840 --> 00:19:58,920
Doesn't matter whose support she's got.

296
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:03,320
Anyone who dares cause trouble here

297
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:07,680
and drag the Wei family
into disgrace again

298
00:20:09,280 --> 00:20:10,920
don't blame me, a grandmother,

299
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:13,280
for setting aside the ties of kinship.

300
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:16,000
Let's go back.

301
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:24,920
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

302
00:20:45,760 --> 00:20:46,960
Maternal Grandmother,
you heard everything.

303
00:20:47,800 --> 00:20:49,480
Grandmother is cruel and vicious.

304
00:20:49,560 --> 00:20:51,040
She has disowned me.

305
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:55,520
Kneel.

306
00:20:58,640 --> 00:20:59,720
Kneel!

307
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:04,080
Tell me what you did honestly.

308
00:21:06,840 --> 00:21:09,080
- Kneel.
- I didn't do anything wrong. Why should I?

309
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:14,080
Lu Zhuo was seriously injured
and was going to die.

310
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:16,280
The Lus kept forcing me to get married.

311
00:21:16,360 --> 00:21:19,040
I didn't want to become a widow
so I found myself a substitute.

312
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:22,320
Later, Lu Zhuo survived by luck.

313
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:24,920
That wretch clung to her status
and wouldn't return the position.

314
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:26,800
Why can't I kill her?

315
00:21:28,360 --> 00:21:31,800
How dare a lowly peasant stand against me?

316
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:35,400
Maternal Grandmother.

317
00:21:36,040 --> 00:21:37,760
You're so domineering and willful.

318
00:21:37,840 --> 00:21:40,760
How are you anything like your mother?

319
00:21:40,840 --> 00:21:43,240
Maternal Grandmother, you're so unfair.

320
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:50,360
Mother didn't want to become a widow,
so you asked her to marry someone else.

321
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:53,120
You even praised her courage.

322
00:21:53,200 --> 00:21:55,480
How come it's wrong when I do the same?

323
00:21:55,560 --> 00:21:57,880
What? She shouldn't have
to be my father's widow,

324
00:21:57,960 --> 00:21:59,360
but I have to be Lu Zhuo's widow?

325
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:00,960
You…

326
00:22:01,040 --> 00:22:03,640
Maternal Grandmother. Calm down.

327
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:05,960
Rao is ignorant and reckless.

328
00:22:06,040 --> 00:22:07,120
She needs to be punished.

329
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:10,440
But the important thing now
isn't getting angry at her,

330
00:22:10,520 --> 00:22:13,440
but to plan for her future.

331
00:22:17,760 --> 00:22:18,680
Keep talking.

332
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:24,480
Maternal Grandmother,
I spoke with the wretch.

333
00:22:25,160 --> 00:22:27,920
She is cunning and calculative.

334
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:30,480
Her flattering words
gained the Duchess' favor.

335
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:31,880
Even Lord Lu was…

336
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:34,880
He was bewitched by her.

337
00:22:35,400 --> 00:22:38,200
In a few days, she established
a foothold at the Duke's Residence.

338
00:22:38,800 --> 00:22:40,280
She's certainly no pushover.

339
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:43,640
However, Old Madam Wei won't stand up
for Rao to protect her reputation.

340
00:22:44,760 --> 00:22:45,920
After this grave mistake,

341
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:48,800
there is no choice
but to ask Aunt in the palace to…

342
00:22:48,880 --> 00:22:50,080
Shut up!

343
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:54,200
Your aunt isn't the one
in control of the harem.

344
00:22:54,280 --> 00:22:56,640
Do you want her to go against
the Empress Dowager's decree?

345
00:22:57,240 --> 00:22:59,000
Her own daughter committed an atrocity.

346
00:22:59,080 --> 00:23:01,640
You're practically giving them
a knife to use against you.

347
00:23:04,160 --> 00:23:06,520
Maternal Grandmother,
you should send a message to Mother

348
00:23:06,600 --> 00:23:09,960
so she won't be fooled by an impostor
and treat her like her own daughter.

349
00:23:13,360 --> 00:23:14,800
What a tragedy.

350
00:23:14,880 --> 00:23:19,360
Your reckless actions last night
have probably given them a heads-up.

351
00:23:20,360 --> 00:23:23,960
Do not act recklessly anymore
unless you have a foolproof plan.

352
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:26,680
The palace is full of prying eyes.

353
00:23:26,760 --> 00:23:29,320
We must be cautious when sending messages.

354
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:32,120
I will find a way.
Let's wait for an opportunity.

355
00:23:32,800 --> 00:23:33,960
- I…
- Rao.

356
00:23:34,560 --> 00:23:36,200
We'll listen to you.

357
00:23:46,880 --> 00:23:48,080
We don't need you here anymore.

358
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:49,280
You're dismissed.

359
00:23:49,360 --> 00:23:53,240
His Lordship ordered us
to watch Her Ladyship take her medicine.

360
00:23:53,320 --> 00:23:54,600
I dare not go against his order.

361
00:24:01,240 --> 00:24:02,640
Here, My Lady.

362
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:13,400
My Lady, have a candied fruit.

363
00:24:23,640 --> 00:24:25,280
My Lady, your stomach is in pain.

364
00:24:25,360 --> 00:24:27,320
Why did you go through with the Nuo dance?

365
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:31,120
You were the victor
and received all the praise.

366
00:24:31,720 --> 00:24:33,920
Why are you still upset?

367
00:24:35,600 --> 00:24:36,600
It's too quiet.

368
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:40,400
I'm afraid.

369
00:24:41,200 --> 00:24:42,440
What are you afraid of?

370
00:24:43,080 --> 00:24:45,080
The calm before the storm.

371
00:24:53,400 --> 00:24:54,240
Bitao.

372
00:24:54,960 --> 00:24:56,840
There's something on my mind.

373
00:24:57,440 --> 00:25:00,560
If you can't decide what to do, what then?

374
00:25:01,520 --> 00:25:03,600
My Lady, what about tossing bamboo tokens?

375
00:25:08,800 --> 00:25:12,360
If they land on different sides,
what you want can be done.

376
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:15,280
If both land on the dark side,
it's forbidden by Heaven.

377
00:25:15,360 --> 00:25:18,000
If both land on the bright side,
you have to do it again.

378
00:25:18,080 --> 00:25:19,960
What do you want to ask, My Lady?

379
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:24,840
Lord Lu is arrogant and suspicious.

380
00:25:25,360 --> 00:25:27,080
He kept testing me. A real handful.

381
00:25:32,240 --> 00:25:34,320
The capital is full of nobles.

382
00:25:35,160 --> 00:25:37,320
He is not the only one I can rely on.

383
00:25:38,880 --> 00:25:40,520
I want to ask Heaven.

384
00:25:42,560 --> 00:25:44,600
Is it possible to rely on someone else?

385
00:25:52,960 --> 00:25:54,880
My Lady, they both land on the dark side.

386
00:25:54,960 --> 00:25:56,040
Heaven says it's not viable.

387
00:25:56,120 --> 00:25:57,720
It's impossible.

388
00:26:00,520 --> 00:26:02,360
Heaven says no.

389
00:26:04,520 --> 00:26:05,960
But I say otherwise.

390
00:26:18,480 --> 00:26:19,720
Be careful.

391
00:26:19,800 --> 00:26:20,960
- Here. I will take it.
- Okay.

392
00:26:21,560 --> 00:26:22,680
Be careful.

393
00:26:22,760 --> 00:26:23,680
What's going on?

394
00:26:23,760 --> 00:26:25,320
Who told you to move all of these?

395
00:26:25,920 --> 00:26:28,400
Put them back. Put all of them back.

396
00:26:31,280 --> 00:26:33,440
My Lord. Old Madam says

397
00:26:33,520 --> 00:26:36,000
a newly married couple
cannot live separately for too long.

398
00:26:36,600 --> 00:26:39,720
If people start talking,
it'll also be a disgrace for Her Ladyship.

399
00:26:39,800 --> 00:26:43,000
Old Madam asks you
to move back to the inner quarters.

400
00:26:44,280 --> 00:26:45,640
That won't do.

401
00:26:45,720 --> 00:26:47,200
Lord Lu isn't fully recovered yet.

402
00:26:47,960 --> 00:26:51,120
The physician ordered him to
abstain from carnal pleasures strictly.

403
00:26:51,880 --> 00:26:53,400
My Lord, am I right?

404
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:57,080
I understand.

405
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:59,400
You hear that? Pack up everything.

406
00:26:59,480 --> 00:27:00,880
Be careful.

407
00:27:00,960 --> 00:27:04,200
Don't be clumsy and
damage His Lordship's military scrolls.

408
00:27:04,280 --> 00:27:05,440
‪Got it.

409
00:27:32,440 --> 00:27:34,160
I didn't mean to doubt you.

410
00:27:37,280 --> 00:27:39,000
I heard reports from the servants

411
00:27:39,520 --> 00:27:43,120
that you tossed the Han family's gift
for some unknown reason.

412
00:27:43,760 --> 00:27:45,360
Also the secret meeting with your cousin.

413
00:27:46,360 --> 00:27:47,920
I was worried that
other people might find out

414
00:27:48,440 --> 00:27:50,040
and gossip about it.

415
00:27:50,560 --> 00:27:51,680
It would make you upset.

416
00:27:54,080 --> 00:27:55,640
I didn't mean to test you,

417
00:27:58,040 --> 00:27:59,560
much less hurt you.

418
00:28:17,880 --> 00:28:20,840
If you don't like it,
I won't question any further.

419
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:23,160
However, the time limit
of one or two years,

420
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:25,680
don't bring it up so casually anymore.

421
00:28:25,760 --> 00:28:29,800
If my grandmother finds out,
it is bound to cause a huge uproar.

422
00:28:30,840 --> 00:28:32,680
Grandmother had someone
move my belongings here.

423
00:28:33,280 --> 00:28:34,440
I'll ask them

424
00:28:34,520 --> 00:28:36,360
to move all my stuff to the adjacent room.

425
00:28:37,160 --> 00:28:38,280
I'll be staying over there.

426
00:28:46,600 --> 00:28:47,440
Wei Rao?

427
00:28:55,560 --> 00:28:56,800
Servants!

428
00:28:58,280 --> 00:29:00,760
My Lord, General Qi
is here to pay a sick visit.

429
00:29:00,840 --> 00:29:02,680
Her Ladyship is greeting him
at Jiangyun Hall now.

430
00:29:03,680 --> 00:29:05,360
JIANGYUN HALL

431
00:29:05,440 --> 00:29:08,080
The Zhongwan pressure point

432
00:29:08,600 --> 00:29:10,280
is located in the upper abdomen,
roughly one,

433
00:29:10,360 --> 00:29:13,080
two, three, four inches above.

434
00:29:13,160 --> 00:29:16,120
I understand now
after your demonstration, General Qi.

435
00:29:34,160 --> 00:29:35,640
What's going on in here?

436
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:36,680
It's all smoky and stifling.

437
00:29:37,560 --> 00:29:40,080
Anyone who didn't know
would think there's a fire in here.

438
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:43,320
Lady Wei Rao has a stomach problem

439
00:29:43,400 --> 00:29:45,120
must be a weak constitution,

440
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:46,160
made worse by the cold.

441
00:29:46,840 --> 00:29:49,040
I'm teaching Bitao to use
a moxibustion stick to treat the <i>Zhongwan,</i>

442
00:29:49,120 --> 00:29:50,520
<i>Liangmen,</i> and <i>Zusanli</i> points.

443
00:29:50,600 --> 00:29:52,440
She only needs
the treatment every other day.

444
00:29:52,960 --> 00:29:54,040
It'll be beneficial for her.

445
00:29:55,120 --> 00:29:57,920
<i>You even know her maid's name?</i>

446
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:01,600
I've known you for so many years,

447
00:30:02,560 --> 00:30:04,520
but I didn't know you knew moxibustion.

448
00:30:04,600 --> 00:30:06,280
Little food and medicine
back at the frontier.

449
00:30:06,360 --> 00:30:07,400
What we lacked most were physicians.

450
00:30:08,080 --> 00:30:10,920
I've treated wounds
for you and the soldiers.

451
00:30:11,440 --> 00:30:13,240
This is nothing much for me.

452
00:30:15,160 --> 00:30:16,960
From your mistress's complexion,

453
00:30:17,040 --> 00:30:18,920
too much cold, raw food.
Her <i>qi</i> is insufficient.

454
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:20,480
She should cut down on noodles.

455
00:30:20,560 --> 00:30:21,800
It's bad for digestion.

456
00:30:22,560 --> 00:30:25,040
If she can't have rice on its own,
you can steam it with sweet dates.

457
00:30:25,920 --> 00:30:27,120
I understand.

458
00:30:28,360 --> 00:30:31,680
You haven't told me where the <i>Liangmen</i>
and <i>Zusanli</i> points are located.

459
00:30:32,480 --> 00:30:34,080
Why did you stop?

460
00:30:35,680 --> 00:30:36,560
Also on the upper abdomen.

461
00:30:38,480 --> 00:30:40,600
Look. This is the <i>Liangmen</i> pressure point.

462
00:30:44,720 --> 00:30:45,920
This is the <i>Zusanli</i> point.

463
00:30:51,360 --> 00:30:52,560
My Lord, what do you want?

464
00:30:55,080 --> 00:30:56,240
This is a small room.

465
00:30:56,320 --> 00:30:58,560
What if you're choked
by the moxibustion smoke?

466
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:12,280
All of you, leave.

467
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:20,960
What? Did you two argue?

468
00:31:21,600 --> 00:31:24,000
General Qi, you are close to Lord Lu.

469
00:31:24,080 --> 00:31:25,520
Tell me.

470
00:31:26,160 --> 00:31:31,480
Why would a husband
refuse to open up to his wife?

471
00:31:32,000 --> 00:31:35,600
No matter how hard I beg,
he will not communicate with me.

472
00:31:36,200 --> 00:31:38,960
And why would he
sleep in a different room and ignore me?

473
00:31:39,560 --> 00:31:41,760
When I accidentally touch his hand,

474
00:31:41,840 --> 00:31:43,200
he will be enraged

475
00:31:43,720 --> 00:31:46,200
as if I'm infected with the plague
and will transmit it to him.

476
00:31:47,320 --> 00:31:49,680
You are the one who knows him best.

477
00:31:49,760 --> 00:31:51,240
Please enlighten me.

478
00:31:51,840 --> 00:31:56,400
Am I so hideous and vulgar
that I'm not worth a glance?

479
00:31:57,000 --> 00:31:59,040
Naturally, you're… very pretty.

480
00:32:00,760 --> 00:32:03,640
However, Lu Zhuo
is someone who doesn't show his feelings.

481
00:32:05,200 --> 00:32:06,200
Don't take it to heart.

482
00:32:07,800 --> 00:32:11,840
Perhaps he hates me
and dislikes everything about me.

483
00:32:13,120 --> 00:32:15,000
It's all the fault
of useless generals like you.

484
00:32:16,000 --> 00:32:17,840
I really hate that war.

485
00:32:17,920 --> 00:32:21,000
It ties up two people who hate each other.

486
00:32:22,040 --> 00:32:24,240
My life has been ruined.

487
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:40,680
I don't know how to comfort you.

488
00:32:41,360 --> 00:32:42,880
Whatever I say will be wrong now.

489
00:32:44,120 --> 00:32:45,000
Please accept my apology.

490
00:32:54,600 --> 00:32:56,160
Who needs your apology?

491
00:32:56,840 --> 00:32:59,520
Is it also your fault that he hates me?

492
00:33:00,840 --> 00:33:02,680
In the future,
if you are upset with anything,

493
00:33:02,760 --> 00:33:03,680
just tell me.

494
00:33:04,320 --> 00:33:07,160
If I can be of your service,
I will never refuse.

495
00:33:07,240 --> 00:33:09,960
GALAXY OF VERSES

496
00:33:10,040 --> 00:33:11,520
It's my own misfortune.

497
00:33:12,320 --> 00:33:13,880
Who are you to me?

498
00:33:13,960 --> 00:33:15,800
I dare not ask you to serve me.

499
00:33:17,080 --> 00:33:19,800
Leave. Never return again.

500
00:33:20,320 --> 00:33:21,800
I also get angry when I see you.

501
00:33:24,720 --> 00:33:26,160
Lady Wei Rao, take care.

502
00:33:32,120 --> 00:33:33,120
Why didn't you address me
as sister-in-law?

503
00:33:36,680 --> 00:33:37,960
How rude.

504
00:34:21,000 --> 00:34:23,719
Eating rice with soup
is bad for your illness.

505
00:34:24,320 --> 00:34:25,679
Old habits die hard.

506
00:34:33,600 --> 00:34:36,280
Don't you have anything to say to me?

507
00:34:36,880 --> 00:34:38,520
No chatting while dining.

508
00:34:39,280 --> 00:34:41,120
I'm not trying to control your behavior,

509
00:34:41,639 --> 00:34:43,280
but Qi Zhongkai is an outsider.

510
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:44,920
I've taken a fancy to your good friend.

511
00:34:46,280 --> 00:34:47,120
What did you say?

512
00:34:50,719 --> 00:34:54,600
I'm telling you that I fancy Qi Zhongkai.

513
00:34:57,960 --> 00:34:59,200
A married woman

514
00:34:59,280 --> 00:35:01,440
saying something like that
before her husband.

515
00:35:01,520 --> 00:35:02,800
How dare you?

516
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:04,800
Why not?

517
00:35:04,880 --> 00:35:06,160
I'm rather ignorant.

518
00:35:06,760 --> 00:35:07,600
I knew that your mother was in a rush

519
00:35:07,680 --> 00:35:09,280
to marry someone else
after your father passed away,

520
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:11,320
but I didn't expect you to outdo her.

521
00:35:11,920 --> 00:35:13,560
You've been married for a mere two months,

522
00:35:13,640 --> 00:35:15,000
and you already
set your eye on another man.

523
00:35:15,080 --> 00:35:17,000
Your husband is still alive!

524
00:35:17,080 --> 00:35:17,920
You…

525
00:35:22,040 --> 00:35:23,440
Shameless!

526
00:35:24,240 --> 00:35:26,920
I only married into the Lu family
for the auspicious match.

527
00:35:28,120 --> 00:35:29,960
Your cousin came to fetch the bride.

528
00:35:30,040 --> 00:35:31,200
I went through the ritual with a rooster.

529
00:35:32,080 --> 00:35:34,680
Later, you even refused
to take me as your wife.

530
00:35:34,760 --> 00:35:37,440
I've never worshipped
at your ancestral hall.

531
00:35:37,960 --> 00:35:39,040
The ritual hasn't been completed.

532
00:35:39,760 --> 00:35:41,480
I'm not considered
a bride of the Lu family.

533
00:35:42,240 --> 00:35:45,120
What binds us is just a decree
from the Empress Dowager.

534
00:35:46,240 --> 00:35:48,040
Yet imperial decree
is inferior to human hearts.

535
00:35:48,640 --> 00:35:50,560
Marriage is determined by fate,

536
00:35:50,640 --> 00:35:51,600
never meant to be forced.

537
00:35:52,200 --> 00:35:55,640
After all, one year will go by
in the blink of an eye.

538
00:35:56,520 --> 00:35:57,880
I must make plans for myself after all.

539
00:36:06,360 --> 00:36:09,280
Then, what do you plan to do?

540
00:36:13,760 --> 00:36:15,040
I heard

541
00:36:15,800 --> 00:36:17,160
you've fancied someone else for a while.

542
00:36:17,760 --> 00:36:19,840
Xie Hualou is indeed pretty and talented.

543
00:36:20,360 --> 00:36:23,960
Now, I'm willing to be the matchmaker
and plan for both of you.

544
00:36:24,640 --> 00:36:27,840
In the future,
when both of you marry each other,

545
00:36:28,520 --> 00:36:31,640
let's call it making up for my mistakes.

546
00:36:32,720 --> 00:36:33,560
So?

547
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:40,360
The Xie family has been
grand tutors for two dynasties.

548
00:36:40,440 --> 00:36:42,800
They would never allow their granddaughter
to be someone's second wife.

549
00:36:42,880 --> 00:36:43,960
This isn't easy.

550
00:36:44,040 --> 00:36:45,640
Without my help,

551
00:36:45,720 --> 00:36:47,960
you will never be with her.

552
00:36:48,040 --> 00:36:49,040
So,

553
00:36:50,480 --> 00:36:52,120
I won't do this
without getting something in return.

554
00:36:53,320 --> 00:36:56,280
You want me to matchmake you two
as a middleman?

555
00:36:56,880 --> 00:36:57,840
Not at all.

556
00:36:58,840 --> 00:37:01,040
I just need you to be tolerant

557
00:37:02,080 --> 00:37:03,080
and generous.

558
00:37:04,160 --> 00:37:05,320
If you don't interfere,

559
00:37:06,520 --> 00:37:08,720
I have my own way of making this happen.

560
00:37:10,560 --> 00:37:11,400
I understand.

561
00:37:16,200 --> 00:37:17,760
Lord Lu, you don't look too well.

562
00:37:19,680 --> 00:37:20,560
What's wrong?

563
00:37:22,560 --> 00:37:23,880
Everything you said is reasonable.

564
00:37:23,960 --> 00:37:26,680
Since we are not a real couple,
I can't tell you what to do.

565
00:37:27,280 --> 00:37:30,280
Your plan is perfect,
but extremely difficult to execute.

566
00:37:31,240 --> 00:37:32,160
After all,

567
00:37:32,680 --> 00:37:34,480
the tongue is as sharp as a sword.

568
00:37:34,560 --> 00:37:35,640
It kills without spilling blood.

569
00:37:36,600 --> 00:37:38,560
All three families are nobles.

570
00:37:39,880 --> 00:37:41,640
Fooling around with marriage
is ridiculous.

571
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:53,880
Even if you have a plan,
you need to carry it out slowly.

572
00:37:55,040 --> 00:37:57,960
Don't draw attention and act so openly.

573
00:37:58,040 --> 00:38:01,680
I will be cautious
and not make myself a laughingstock.

574
00:38:08,320 --> 00:38:10,760
Thank you, my Lord,
for your gracious favor.

575
00:38:18,080 --> 00:38:22,760
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

576
00:38:27,920 --> 00:38:29,160
My Lady, don't stay out.

577
00:38:29,240 --> 00:38:30,880
You might fall ill again at night.

578
00:38:34,560 --> 00:38:35,600
Why are you laughing, My Lady?

579
00:38:36,760 --> 00:38:40,320
I'm laughing because someone might
get too angry to sleep tonight.

580
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:44,800
My Lady, do you mean…

581
00:38:44,880 --> 00:38:46,720
Madam Liu used to tell me

582
00:38:47,520 --> 00:38:49,240
that that's all there is to humanity.

583
00:38:50,240 --> 00:38:52,280
People don't cherish what they get easily.

584
00:38:52,920 --> 00:38:56,680
When there's competition,
even slop tastes better.

585
00:38:59,360 --> 00:39:00,320
Go to sleep.

586
00:39:09,040 --> 00:39:11,520
SONGYUE HALL

587
00:39:15,680 --> 00:39:17,120
SHIZHAI

588
00:39:18,600 --> 00:39:20,200
The wounds haven't completely healed yet.

589
00:39:20,280 --> 00:39:22,800
Yet practicing swordsmanship
since midnight.

590
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:25,280
Where's all this energy coming from?

591
00:39:33,560 --> 00:39:34,760
Zhuo.

592
00:39:37,000 --> 00:39:37,840
It's me.

593
00:39:41,960 --> 00:39:43,080
It's you?

594
00:39:44,000 --> 00:39:47,520
My eyes are blurred,
and I couldn't recognize you.

595
00:39:50,080 --> 00:39:52,920
Old Madam threatened
to confine you here with her life.

596
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:55,040
I am kind enough
to bring you news from court.

597
00:39:55,760 --> 00:39:57,440
Is this how you repay me?

598
00:39:58,480 --> 00:40:00,000
<i>I've taken a fancy to your good friend.</i>

599
00:40:03,600 --> 00:40:04,640
Zhao Song.

600
00:40:07,360 --> 00:40:09,280
Lying around all day,
everything feels weak.

601
00:40:10,520 --> 00:40:11,360
Just got the itch, that's all.

602
00:40:12,040 --> 00:40:13,480
When you are fully recovered,

603
00:40:14,080 --> 00:40:15,320
I'll practice with you.

604
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:16,480
Are the Hans attempting something again?

605
00:40:17,480 --> 00:40:18,720
You are right.

606
00:40:19,360 --> 00:40:21,360
The Hans have offered
many treasures to the palace.

607
00:40:21,880 --> 00:40:23,000
They have been recorded here.

608
00:40:23,080 --> 00:40:24,600
Han Liao might be
the Empress Dowager's family,

609
00:40:24,680 --> 00:40:26,160
but he's a distant relative.

610
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:28,760
Without the Marquis of Xiting
and his son's help,

611
00:40:29,840 --> 00:40:30,960
he wouldn't have climbed
up the ranks so quickly.

612
00:40:35,680 --> 00:40:36,720
Jiede,

613
00:40:37,600 --> 00:40:39,480
I asked you to buy the Pig Skin Pancake.

614
00:40:40,040 --> 00:40:41,280
Did you get them?

615
00:40:46,760 --> 00:40:47,720
I sent someone to get them yesterday.

616
00:40:48,320 --> 00:40:49,480
Please give me one more day.

617
00:40:49,560 --> 00:40:50,520
I'll surely get it tomorrow.

618
00:40:51,520 --> 00:40:52,360
Pig Skin Pancake?

619
00:40:54,880 --> 00:40:57,800
The pastry Wei Rao saw at the Western
Market on the night of Qixi.

620
00:40:58,440 --> 00:41:00,960
She said it was a pancake
made from rice slurry.

621
00:41:01,040 --> 00:41:03,200
After drizzling hemp milk on it,
its skin is as smooth as a pig's skin.

622
00:41:03,280 --> 00:41:05,880
Unfortunately,
we left in a hurry and didn't buy it.

623
00:41:06,400 --> 00:41:08,640
When we came back,
it was always on her mind.

624
00:41:11,240 --> 00:41:12,080
Keep searching.

625
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:13,720
Yes.

626
00:41:16,720 --> 00:41:18,800
Pig Skin Pancake?

627
00:41:18,880 --> 00:41:22,000
MANIFEST AND MAKE YOUR VIRTUE SHINE

628
00:41:33,360 --> 00:41:36,560
My Lord, General Qi left his residence
and headed east.

629
00:41:38,600 --> 00:41:40,840
- East?
- Yes. The people tailing him said

630
00:41:40,920 --> 00:41:42,480
he first went to the Western Market,

631
00:41:42,560 --> 00:41:43,600
before going to Liu Market.

632
00:41:44,200 --> 00:41:45,400
He seemed to be looking for something.

633
00:41:49,320 --> 00:41:51,200
MANIFEST AND MAKE YOUR VIRTUE SHINE

634
00:41:54,680 --> 00:41:56,320
Both of them have feelings for each other.

635
00:41:57,760 --> 00:41:59,040
I, the husband,

636
00:42:00,120 --> 00:42:02,000
have become irrelevant.

637
00:42:02,720 --> 00:42:04,120
I'm merely an eyesore here.

638
00:42:04,840 --> 00:42:07,160
MANIFEST AND MAKE YOUR VIRTUE SHINE

639
00:42:09,160 --> 00:42:10,640
It is said that
the great affairs of a state

640
00:42:10,720 --> 00:42:11,640
are sacrifice and war.

641
00:42:11,720 --> 00:42:13,520
What holds true for a state
holds true for a family as well.

642
00:42:13,600 --> 00:42:16,400
In the past, you were the one organizing
the Mengqiu Family Mourning Ritual.

643
00:42:17,280 --> 00:42:18,200
Yesterday, Mother told me

644
00:42:18,880 --> 00:42:20,680
that hosting the ritual
was the principal wife's duty.

645
00:42:21,360 --> 00:42:23,320
Mother is weak and can't handle the task.

646
00:42:23,920 --> 00:42:25,760
That's why you have had to carry
the burden at such an old age.

647
00:42:26,360 --> 00:42:27,760
With a bride this year,

648
00:42:29,680 --> 00:42:30,600
Mother will have another helper.

649
00:42:31,200 --> 00:42:32,920
It is only natural
for her to manage the ritual.

650
00:42:35,800 --> 00:42:37,480
Young Master, you are still young.

651
00:42:37,560 --> 00:42:38,600
You don't know what's important.

652
00:42:39,280 --> 00:42:42,360
The ritual is different from organizing
Mother's birthday banquet.

653
00:42:42,440 --> 00:42:44,480
The birthday banquet
is a celebratory event.

654
00:42:44,560 --> 00:42:46,760
It's fine as long as
there aren't any major mistakes.

655
00:42:46,840 --> 00:42:49,160
The mourning ritual
is a huge thing for the clan.

656
00:42:50,000 --> 00:42:51,680
Not only are the rules complicated,

657
00:42:51,760 --> 00:42:55,760
but hundreds of people from the clan
will be watching and looking for faults.

658
00:42:56,360 --> 00:42:58,640
You better not cause trouble
for your wife.

659
00:42:59,240 --> 00:43:00,440
Right.

660
00:43:00,960 --> 00:43:04,120
Wanniang. You have always
been calm and unassuming.

661
00:43:04,200 --> 00:43:06,080
You don't like meddling
in the clan's business.

662
00:43:06,160 --> 00:43:07,760
The children are eager for quick success.

663
00:43:07,840 --> 00:43:09,080
Can't you talk to them?

664
00:43:09,800 --> 00:43:10,640
Exactly.

665
00:43:13,040 --> 00:43:14,800
Both of you are right.

666
00:43:15,400 --> 00:43:17,640
The Mengqiu Family Mourning Ritual
is a big deal.

667
00:43:18,240 --> 00:43:20,040
I dare not host it no matter what.

668
00:43:21,640 --> 00:43:22,640
Don't joke around, My Lord.

669
00:43:23,600 --> 00:43:26,760
I'm proposing this
because of another reason.

670
00:43:28,600 --> 00:43:31,320
A marriage ties two families together.

671
00:43:31,400 --> 00:43:33,560
They are to honor the ancestors
and carry on the family lineage.

672
00:43:34,240 --> 00:43:35,480
When a woman marries into the family,

673
00:43:35,560 --> 00:43:37,000
she must first go through the ceremony

674
00:43:37,080 --> 00:43:40,360
to get the ancestors' blessing before
she can become a part of the Lu family.

675
00:43:41,960 --> 00:43:44,160
During the wedding, I was sick

676
00:43:44,760 --> 00:43:46,560
and failed to present my wife
to the ancestors.

677
00:43:47,080 --> 00:43:48,240
At the time of Mengqiu Family Ritual,

678
00:43:49,040 --> 00:43:50,080
we can make up for the ancestral ceremony.

679
00:43:56,080 --> 00:43:59,960
Grandmother, Wei Rao's marriage blessed me
and saved my life.

680
00:44:00,040 --> 00:44:02,080
If I made her a subject of gossip
due to incomplete rites,

681
00:44:03,000 --> 00:44:04,840
the Heaven will punish me.

682
00:44:04,920 --> 00:44:08,400
Old Madam, there's no need for this.

683
00:44:08,920 --> 00:44:11,640
I dare not manage the family ritual.

684
00:44:12,240 --> 00:44:14,520
You young ones know nothing.

685
00:44:14,600 --> 00:44:17,560
A bride going through
the ancestral temple ceremony

686
00:44:17,640 --> 00:44:19,600
is more important
than greeting the aunts and uncles.

687
00:44:19,680 --> 00:44:24,400
Once a bride bows to the ancestors,
it's set in stone.

688
00:44:25,080 --> 00:44:28,920
You will be the Lu family's
principal wife,

689
00:44:29,000 --> 00:44:32,280
the Duke's Residence's
future lady of the house.

690
00:44:33,800 --> 00:44:36,000
Rao, you hear that?

691
00:44:36,080 --> 00:44:39,840
Lu Zhuo is the eldest son,
the pillar of the family.

692
00:44:39,920 --> 00:44:42,080
He will inherit
the duke's title in the future.

693
00:44:42,160 --> 00:44:44,200
You've got a heavy load
on your shoulders too.

694
00:44:44,280 --> 00:44:47,000
Forget the distant ones,
consider these two aunts before you.

695
00:44:47,880 --> 00:44:48,960
They might be your elders,

696
00:44:49,040 --> 00:44:51,040
But for big clan affairs

697
00:44:51,120 --> 00:44:53,360
they have to take orders
from the clan matriarch.

698
00:44:53,440 --> 00:44:54,480
Right?

699
00:44:58,800 --> 00:44:59,720
Rao,

700
00:45:01,920 --> 00:45:03,120
I'll leave everything to you.

701
00:45:12,240 --> 00:45:14,320
LU'S ANCESTRAL TEMPLE

702
00:45:33,840 --> 00:45:35,400
We decided to be a fake couple.

703
00:45:36,160 --> 00:45:37,920
Why must you go through
with the temple ceremony?

704
00:45:38,520 --> 00:45:39,760
So much trouble, for nothing

705
00:45:39,840 --> 00:45:41,200
It will not end well in future.

706
00:45:45,840 --> 00:45:49,120
An old saying goes, "if the title isn't
right, nothing you say carries weight."

707
00:45:50,200 --> 00:45:53,520
Even if you're the principal wife
for just a month and not a year,

708
00:45:53,600 --> 00:45:54,640
managing the household,

709
00:45:54,720 --> 00:45:56,280
attending to guests
and keeping servants in check

710
00:45:56,360 --> 00:45:57,640
are no easy tasks.

711
00:45:57,720 --> 00:45:58,600
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

712
00:45:58,680 --> 00:46:01,240
Wei Rao. My mother is gentle and meek,

713
00:46:01,320 --> 00:46:02,640
but not good at managing people

714
00:46:02,720 --> 00:46:04,840
I hope you can be
a capable wife by my side

715
00:46:04,920 --> 00:46:06,600
to keep my aunts in check.

716
00:46:07,640 --> 00:46:08,920
How can you do that
without a proper title?

717
00:46:09,680 --> 00:46:10,720
That's all?

718
00:46:14,040 --> 00:46:15,560
What else can it be?

719
00:46:17,240 --> 00:46:18,320
No need to be so distrustful.

720
00:46:18,920 --> 00:46:20,520
When it's time to part ways, we do it.

721
00:46:21,040 --> 00:46:22,240
I, Lu Zhuo, am a man of my word.

722
00:46:23,240 --> 00:46:24,760
I won't force you to stay for any longer.

723
00:46:27,560 --> 00:46:29,120
Don't worry.

724
00:46:29,200 --> 00:46:30,080
Your work won't be for nothing.

725
00:46:30,680 --> 00:46:32,600
Grandmother promised you
ten thousand taels of dowry.

726
00:46:32,680 --> 00:46:35,480
A year later, I'll carry out her promise.

727
00:46:36,360 --> 00:46:37,760
I don't want your jewelry.

728
00:46:42,080 --> 00:46:44,840
Do you want people to laugh and say

729
00:46:45,440 --> 00:46:48,640
the Lu family's bride
cannot even be allowed

730
00:46:49,840 --> 00:46:50,880
to pray at the ancestral temple?

731
00:46:50,960 --> 00:46:52,000
You…

732
00:46:57,320 --> 00:46:58,400
Fine, go ahead.

733
00:47:04,560 --> 00:47:06,080
A gentleman's promise must be kept.

734
00:47:06,160 --> 00:47:07,640
You must keep your word.

735
00:47:08,800 --> 00:47:09,720
Don't worry.

736
00:47:12,560 --> 00:47:14,000
Everyone, be careful.

737
00:47:46,560 --> 00:47:48,760
What? She's not in again?

738
00:47:48,840 --> 00:47:50,560
General, she's really not in.

739
00:47:51,160 --> 00:47:53,080
Lady Wei Rao
wants to eat Pig Skin Pancake.

740
00:47:53,160 --> 00:47:54,840
I searched every market to find it

741
00:47:54,920 --> 00:47:56,240
and so it wouldn't go cold,

742
00:47:56,320 --> 00:47:57,800
I brought someone here to make it.

743
00:47:58,320 --> 00:48:00,000
Three days in a row, not a sign of her.

744
00:48:01,000 --> 00:48:02,080
Tell me honestly.

745
00:48:02,640 --> 00:48:03,960
Did you send my message

746
00:48:04,640 --> 00:48:07,160
or did Lu Zhuo purposely prevent us
from meeting each other?

747
00:48:09,600 --> 00:48:11,880
- Ridiculous.
- That's not it.

748
00:48:11,960 --> 00:48:13,200
The Hungry Ghost Festival is near,

749
00:48:13,280 --> 00:48:15,000
Lady Lu is busy preparing for the ritual.

750
00:48:15,080 --> 00:48:17,960
She goes out at sunrise
and only returns at sunset.

751
00:48:18,560 --> 00:48:20,040
She even has to do her hair and makeup
in the horse carriage.

752
00:48:20,120 --> 00:48:21,200
She is too busy to meet guests.

753
00:48:21,280 --> 00:48:23,960
Please forgive her for not meeting you.

754
00:48:26,920 --> 00:48:29,160
Fine. I'll return another day.

755
00:48:30,000 --> 00:48:31,880
Farewell, General. Take care.

756
00:48:31,960 --> 00:48:33,400
LU'S ANCESTRAL TEMPLE

757
00:48:33,480 --> 00:48:36,720
- She's out!
- The bride who blessed the heir is out!

758
00:48:36,800 --> 00:48:39,840
Someone who was almost dead recovered
thanks to her blessing.

759
00:48:39,920 --> 00:48:41,840
She is truly blessed.

760
00:48:41,920 --> 00:48:43,000
What are we still waiting for?

761
00:48:43,080 --> 00:48:45,440
Let's go closer
to get some of her blessing.

762
00:48:45,520 --> 00:48:46,680
Let us get some of your blessing!

763
00:48:46,760 --> 00:48:47,880
Let us get some of your blessing!

764
00:48:47,960 --> 00:48:49,720
A-Chou, I'm here!

765
00:48:49,800 --> 00:48:51,360
- Let us get some!
- It's me!

766
00:48:51,440 --> 00:48:52,760
It's me, A-Chou!

767
00:48:54,200 --> 00:48:55,240
A-Chou!

768
00:48:55,760 --> 00:48:58,120
A-Chou! Over here, A-Chou!

769
00:48:58,200 --> 00:48:59,720
It's me, A-Chou!

770
00:49:00,320 --> 00:49:01,800
I'm here!

771
00:49:01,880 --> 00:49:03,400
- It's me!
- Madam!

772
00:49:04,120 --> 00:49:05,800
- A-Chou!
- Wei Rao.

773
00:49:07,560 --> 00:49:08,920
It's me, A-Chou!

774
00:49:09,520 --> 00:49:11,360
- A-Chou!
- Madam!

775
00:49:11,440 --> 00:49:12,640
A-Chou!

776
00:49:13,160 --> 00:49:14,640
It's me, A-Chou!

777
00:49:15,160 --> 00:49:16,720
A-Chou!

778
00:49:16,800 --> 00:49:17,920
Let us have some blessings!

779
00:49:18,000 --> 00:49:19,160
- A-Chou!
- Let us have some!

780
00:49:19,240 --> 00:49:20,080
A-Chou!

781
00:49:21,240 --> 00:49:22,080
It's me!

782
00:49:22,160 --> 00:49:23,520
A-Chou!

783
00:49:23,600 --> 00:49:24,560
I'm here!

784
00:49:25,400 --> 00:49:26,920
- It's me, A-Chou!
- Don't worry, My Lady.

785
00:49:27,000 --> 00:49:28,840
- Madam!
- A-Chou!

786
00:49:29,720 --> 00:49:31,040
A-Chou!

787
00:49:31,120 --> 00:49:31,960
Get lost!

788
00:49:38,520 --> 00:49:40,320
Come take a look inside.

789
00:49:40,400 --> 00:49:41,360
- Hold it.
- Come inside.

790
00:49:44,280 --> 00:49:45,440
<i>Her Ladyship has ordered</i>

791
00:49:45,520 --> 00:49:48,800
<i>to find the beggar from just now</i>
<i>without causing a scene.</i>

792
00:49:51,640 --> 00:49:52,640
I don't know.

793
00:49:52,720 --> 00:49:53,680
I haven't seen him.

794
00:49:53,760 --> 00:49:55,880
‪-Come and have a look.
‪-These are quite fresh.

795
00:49:55,960 --> 00:49:57,440
‪Good.

796
00:50:08,520 --> 00:50:10,040
A-Chou's really made it.

797
00:50:11,480 --> 00:50:14,360
She lives a better life than the deities!

798
00:50:17,640 --> 00:50:20,920
Tell me. Why didn't she share
all this fortune with us?

799
00:50:21,520 --> 00:50:22,840
Don't speak nonsense.

800
00:50:23,360 --> 00:50:25,800
Ma is very ill,
and we've spent all our money.

801
00:50:25,880 --> 00:50:27,400
That is why we took the risk
to return and find A-Chou.

802
00:50:28,000 --> 00:50:29,280
Did she say when we can meet her?

803
00:50:29,360 --> 00:50:30,800
Mother's illness cannot wait.

804
00:50:32,360 --> 00:50:34,920
I'm late. Sorry for making you wait.

805
00:50:36,800 --> 00:50:37,640
Forgive me.

806
00:50:46,200 --> 00:50:47,280
Where is my sister?

807
00:50:47,360 --> 00:50:48,880
Why isn't she coming to meet us?

808
00:50:49,440 --> 00:50:51,560
Your sister is now the wife of the heir.

809
00:50:51,640 --> 00:50:52,920
She is busy because of her duties.

810
00:50:53,640 --> 00:50:57,760
However, she still cares for you
and told me to take care of you.

811
00:50:59,120 --> 00:51:00,120
Someone.

812
00:51:12,360 --> 00:51:13,400
Quick.

813
00:51:16,200 --> 00:51:18,080
I'm very close to your sister.

814
00:51:18,600 --> 00:51:20,920
I'll treat her mother like my own,

815
00:51:21,800 --> 00:51:25,160
and her siblings like my own.

816
00:51:25,240 --> 00:51:26,840
I've called a famous physician
for you, Madam.

817
00:51:26,920 --> 00:51:28,200
He will be here after the meal.

818
00:51:28,280 --> 00:51:30,840
All of you just need to live here
with peace of mind.

819
00:51:30,920 --> 00:51:33,360
If you need anything, just let me know.

820
00:51:33,960 --> 00:51:34,800
Please.

821
00:51:38,120 --> 00:51:40,360
Since you are A-Chou's friend,
we are a family.

822
00:51:40,440 --> 00:51:42,480
Come. Sit down. Let's eat.

823
00:51:54,360 --> 00:51:55,360
<i>Wei Rao.</i>

824
00:51:55,880 --> 00:51:58,480
<i>I will treat them well for you.</i>

825
00:51:59,520 --> 00:52:01,920
The person
I saw outside the temple that day.

826
00:52:02,000 --> 00:52:04,200
Ask Liangcai to keep an eye in the city.

827
00:52:04,280 --> 00:52:05,760
Report to me if he finds anything.

828
00:52:05,840 --> 00:52:06,840
I understand.

829
00:52:08,600 --> 00:52:09,560
Foolish!

830
00:52:11,280 --> 00:52:12,600
My Lady, you are too kind.

831
00:52:12,680 --> 00:52:14,320
How can you not punish such clumsiness?

832
00:52:14,400 --> 00:52:16,280
It's improper if others see this.

833
00:52:21,200 --> 00:52:22,320
<i>A-Chou, is this nice?</i>

834
00:52:26,960 --> 00:52:29,160
My Lady, to know more about
the red string's owner,

835
00:52:29,760 --> 00:52:32,360
come to Triumph Tavern
at three-quarters past the hour of Wei.

836
00:52:32,440 --> 00:52:34,720
Arrive late, and we won't be waiting.

837
00:54:56,200 --> 00:54:58,520
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
